cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code or the method, please cite it as below.
title: "Soft Range Matching as an Inner Product with a Deterministic Error Bound"
type: software
authors:
  - name: Juuzoe
    website: https://github.com/Juuzoe
repository-code: https://github.com/Juuzoe/ap-alg
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-07
abstract: >-
  Encodes a numeric interval with a Gaussian tolerance as a fixed-length vector,
  so that the inner product of a query vector and a stored vector equals the
  smoothed share of one interval inside the other within an error the user sets in advance.
keywords:
  - vector search
  - range matching
  - Fourier features
  - inner product
